 const messages={none:'No email send has been recorded for this invitation. Choose Send invitation email when ready.',accepted:'Email provider accepted this invitation email. Inbox delivery is not confirmed. Ask the recipient to check inbox and spam, open Set up your member account, then complete account creation and email verification. If needed, use Copy invitation link above to share the same invitation directly; do not create another request.',failed:'The email provider rejected the send. No successful handoff was recorded. You may explicitly retry this invitation email.',pending:'The email handoff is pending or its outcome has not been recorded. Do not send another invitation to compensate. Check email status and the recipient’s inbox first.',unknown:'The email handoff is uncertain. An email may already have been sent. No automatic retry will occur. Check email status and the recipient’s inbox before taking another action.'};
